<title>SINGAPORE: Amara shares jump 80 pct on debut.</title>
<headline>Amara shares jump 80 pct on debut.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in hotel group Amara Holdings Ltd jumped 80 percent to a high of Singapore $0.54 on Friday on their first day of trading after listing.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement on Thursday the public portion of its initial public offer (IPO) was 39.6 times subscribed.</p>
<p>Amara had offered 132 million shares at S$0.30 each.</p>
<p>The offer comprised 79.2 million offer shares and 52.8 million placement shares. All placement shares were fully taken up.</p>
<p>Amara shares stood at S$0.50, up 20 cents, by 0115 GMT.</p>
